  "scope": "On fixed W2, an explicit all-n family has the identical pointed unit Weyl module at fixed b,h, exact scalar order6 and two generated torsion arms, while full original-source torsion has n+1 arms and every rational constant-Jacobian mate gives the same embedded pair field of degree5n+3. The globally submersive first functions on fixed W2 of original source t-degree exactly2 admitting rational mates are completely classified: three families, exact unit-order spectrum{2,3}, two full torsion arms, with the audited unit-cyclicity walls. The new elliptic family and an earlier rational family have the same pointed unit module D/Dg^2. Dependent discriminant pencils are source-critical. Native zero-edge middle depths close connected-complement LRC clocks6930 and7560, leaving7620 clocks. Finite-direction grid repair is exact integral graph matching at original cell incidence at most2 and exact finite branching over higher-incidence cells. All general conjectures remain OPEN; no external priority claim.",
